{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And he feared.</b> On account of his error." "<b>This is none other.</b> This place that I saw in the vision, where the ladder stood, is none other <b>than the house of Elohim</b> — the site of the Temple, as the Sages, of blessed memory, said (Pesachim 88a): Jacob called it a house." "<b>And this is the gate of heaven.</b> And this ladder that I saw indicates that from the place where the ladder stood, the blessed Elohim who stood upon it hears the prayer of those who pray, and their prayer ascends to His holy habitation in heaven."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:12.166826673Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}